    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "FitzGerald’s are delighted to bring to the market No. 59 Westfield for sale by private treaty. The property is a wonderful 3-bedroom semi-detached home, in a much sought after location. This property is ideally positioned within minutes’ walk of a wide range of amenities including Loughboy Shopping Centre, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, primary and secondary schools, recreational facilities including The Watershed and James Stephens GAA Club, churches and Kilkenny city center. It also benefits from easy access to the Ring Road and is 10 minutes from the M9 (Dublin / Waterford) Motorway. \r\n\r\nTo the front of the property is a garden with a private driveway providing off road parking. The internal ground floor accommodation comprises of an entrance hall, a good-sized family bathroom, an open plan kitchen / dining room which has been recently renovated, a double bedroom with a built-in wardrobe and a large sitting room with a bay window and solid fuel stove. Upstairs is comprised of two double bedrooms with spacious built-in wardrobes, shower room including WC and an electric shower. To rear of the property is a south-facing patio accessible via the kitchen or through an up & over garage door and a detached block-built shed.  \r\n\r\nThis is a superb opportunity to purchase a home in a very desirable location. It would be an ideal home for a first-time buyer, excellent investment opportunity or downsize property.  \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the potential this property offers.    \r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION \r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALL\t2.2m x 3.6m\twith laminate flooring and a hot press. \r\nLIVING ROOM\t4.5m x 3.6m\twith laminate flooring, bay window and a solid fuel stove. \r\nBATHROOM\t\t1.9m x 1.8m \twith tiled floor, WC, WHB and bath with shower. \r\nKITCHEN\t\t3.2m x 4.8m\twith laminate flooring and fitted kitchen units.\r\nBEROOOM 1\t\t2.9m x 3.6m\twith carpet and 4-bay fitted wardrobe.\r\nSHOWER ROOM\t1.8m x 1.4m\twith tiled floor, WC, WHB and electric shower.\r\nBEDROOM 2\t\t3.5m x 3.2m\twith carpet and 6-bay fitted wardrobe with vanity unit. \r\nBEDROOM 3\t\t2.9m x 4.6m\twith carpet and 3-bay fitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nTOTAL AREA\t\t80.4 m2 / 861 sqft\r\n\r\nServices\t                Mains water, mains sewage, electricity, telecoms, UPVC double glazed windows and oil-fired heating."
      },
